                        "review": "I have had countless hours of fun on this game.\n\nHowever, it has been abandoned for years. I know it was recently purchased again, but that has to be a joke. If they were serious, why charge 20 for something with no players? Maybe start with a promotion, as well as some advertising. There was honestly no reason for this game to die like this. It really is a shame, because no other moba gives me any enjoyment. Miss me with LoL, DotA, or the others.\n\nTo old memories.",
